@host = http://localhost:5245

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Registrar usuario (nao aceita roles)
POST {{host}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@expensehub.local",
  "password": "Troque-Esta-Senha-1"
}

### Login (copie o accessToken retornado para a variavel abaixo)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@expensehub.local",
  "password": "Troque-Esta-Senha-1"
}

@accessToken = cole-o-token-aqui
@expenseId = cole-o-id-aqui
@userId = cole-o-id-do-usuario-aqui

### Admin: listar usuarios
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin: definir roles (o usuario precisa autenticar novamente)
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["Employee"]
}

### Employee: criar rascunho
POST {{host}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Taxi ate o aeroporto para reuniao",
  "amount": 120.50,
  "expenseDate": "2026-10-10",
  "categoryId": 4
}

### Employee: editar rascunho
PUT {{host}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Taxi ate o aeroporto para reuniao",
  "amount": 99.90,
  "expenseDate": "2026-10-10"
}

### Listar / detalhar / historico
GET {{host}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Employee: enviar
POST {{host}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Approver: aprovar
POST {{host}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Approver: reprovar (justificativa de 10 a 500 caracteres)
POST {{host}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Comprovante ausente e valor acima do esperado"
}

### Finance: pagar
POST {{host}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### CP3 - Relatorios em segundo plano (use um token diferente por perfil)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

@employeeToken = cole-o-token-do-employee-aqui
@employee2Token = cole-o-token-do-segundo-employee-aqui
@auditorToken = cole-o-token-do-auditor-aqui
@reportId = cole-o-id-do-relatorio-aqui

### Employee: solicitar relatorio Mine (202 + Location)
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2026-09-01",
  "toDate": "2026-09-30",
  "scope": "Mine"
}

### Auditor: solicitar relatorio Global (202 + Location)
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{auditorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2026-09-01",
  "toDate": "2026-09-30",
  "scope": "Global"
}

### Employee: Global negado (403)
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2026-09-01",
  "toDate": "2026-09-30",
  "scope": "Global"
}

### Periodo invertido (400, nada e criado nem publicado)
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2026-09-30",
  "toDate": "2026-09-01",
  "scope": "Mine"
}

### Sem autenticacao (401)
GET {{host}}/api/reports

### Listar somente as solicitacoes do proprio usuario
GET {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Acompanhar (repita ate status Completed)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Baixar o Excel do resultado salvo (200 .xlsx; 409 se ainda nao concluido)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Outro Employee consultando relatorio alheio (404)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employee2Token}}

### Auditor consultando relatorio criado por outro usuario (404)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auditorToken}}

### Auditor baixando Excel de relatorio criado por outro usuario (404)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{auditorToken}}
